# English catalogue for the commune polling platform.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: 0BSD
#
# French is the source language: the msgids are the French interface strings,
# and French is the authoritative version where the two diverge (§3.8). This
# catalogue is therefore the only one needed — reading the site in French uses
# the msgids directly, with no catalogue at all.
#
# Written by hand because GNU gettext was not installed on the machine that
# introduced these strings. Once `gettext` is available, `manage.py makemessages
# -l en` regenerates it with source references and takes over; the msgstrs here
# survive that regeneration.
