msgstr "Choose an address only you read: it will receive the voting link, and that link carries the right to vote. One address can be used only once; two people sharing an address must vote at the mairie."

msgid "Concordance"
msgstr "Match"

msgid "Confirmez votre inscription : %(poll)s"
msgstr "Confirm your registration: %(poll)s"

