msgstr "We could not match your request against the electoral roll automatically. A mairie officer will review it and you will then receive your voting link by email."

msgid "Nous ne pouvons pas enregistrer cette demande en ligne. Veuillez vous adresser à la mairie."
msgstr "We cannot record this request online. Please contact the mairie."

